### Memoized Column Definitions:

```typescript
const MyComponent: FC = () => {
  const columns = useMemo<ColumnDef<MyDataRow>[]>(() => [
    {
      header: 'ID',
      accessorKey: 'id',
      size: 80,
    },
    {
      header: 'Title',
